wsWD6dGWAxUOe_UHHbSnPHMQ3IcHCFwoCw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["間在興南夜市裡的人氣其實蠻高的，第一次來吃整體感受是——有特色，但真的很看口味。\n\n先講湯頭，他們主打雞白湯，走的是偏濃厚路線，入口是有明顯的膠質感跟油脂香氣，喝起來蠻順的，但同時也偏油一點。如果你平常喜歡豚骨那種重口味，應該會蠻喜歡；但如果是偏好清爽拉麵的人，可能喝到後面會覺得有點膩。\n\n黑蒜口味是這間比較多人推的，蒜香會把整個湯頭層次拉起來，比原味更耐吃一點。\n\n麵條是細麵，吸湯效果不錯，整體搭配起來是OK的。雞叉燒是走舒肥路線，口感蠻嫩的，不會乾柴，算是加分。溏心蛋也有一定水準，不會雷。\n\n不過環境就比較現實一點，畢竟是在夜市裡，用餐空間就是簡單座位，夏天會偏悶熱，整體舒適度沒辦法跟一般拉麵店比。\n\n價格部分算親民，以這個濃度跟用料來說，CP值是有的。",null,[0,40]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12222328628757792999/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLTWxNeFRrNU5WRVV3VGpOT2FGSXdSa05pYkRneVpHdG9SRlJGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12222328628757792999/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLTWxNeFRrNU5WRVV3VGpOT2FGSXdSa05pYkRneVpHdG9SRlJGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12222328628757792999/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLTWxNeFRrNU5WRVV3VGpOT2FGSXdSa05pYkRneVpHdG9SRlJGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12222328628757792999/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLTWxNeFRrNU5WRVV3VGpOT2FGSXdSa05pYkRneVpHdG9SRlJGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12222328628757792999/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLTWxNeFRrNU5WRVV3VGpOT2FGSXdSa05pYkRneVpHdG9SRlJGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12222328628757792999/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLTWxNeFRrNU5WRVV3VGpOT2FGSXdSa05pYkRneVpHdG9SRlJGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2110,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKMlMxTk5NVEUwTjNOaFIwRkNibDgyZGtoRFRFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa5907297c0819f8!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjJ2S1NNMTE0N3NhR0FCbl82dkhDTEE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENod